cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Artificial Ontogeny: Syntactic emergence in Pythia and its alignment with human language acquisition"
abstract: >-
  A longitudinal study of syntactic acquisition in the Pythia model suite across
  pre-training checkpoints, evaluated on BLiMP/Zorro minimal pairs, testing for
  non-monotonic (U-shaped) learning curves and ordinal alignment with human age
  of acquisition (Wordbank/CHILDES).
type: software
